{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","group":"89","path":"89/89-book-info.md","title":"The Logic of Provability — George Boolos","display":"The Logic of Provability — George Boolos","type":"book","metadata":{"type":"book","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-book-info","aliases":["89-book-info"],"display":"The Logic of Provability — George Boolos","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"book"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-book-info"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-book-info</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"The Logic of Provability — George Boolos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"The-Logic-of-Provability\">The Logic of Provability</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{89}\">\\(B_{89}\\)</span> (book metadata object)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Author\">Author</h2>\n<p>George Boolos</p>\n<h2 id=\"Description\">Description</h2>\n<p>关于可证性逻辑(Provability Logic, GL)的专著，深入探讨模态逻辑与哥德尔不完备性定理之间的联系。本书系统研究了可证性逻辑的语法、语义和应用，是该领域的经典之作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Core-Topics\">Core Topics</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Provability Logic (可证性逻辑)</li>\n<li>Modal Logic GL (模态逻辑GL)</li>\n<li>Löb's Theorem (Löb定理)</li>\n<li>Fixed Points (不动点)</li>\n<li>Solovay's Theorem (Solovay定理)</li>\n<li>Arithmetic Interpretation (算术解释)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Repair-Additions\">Repair Additions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a> — 模态语言的命题重言式集合</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a> — 模态子公式与出现变元集合</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78885ae02bfb25f\" href=\"?note=c78885ae02bfb25f\" title=\"89-df-box-free-fragment\">89-df-box-free-fragment</a> — 无盒命题片段</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f12af111ab11110d\" href=\"?note=f12af111ab11110d\" title=\"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic\">89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic</a> — IPC theorem-set 接口</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c0998e9f7d64222\" href=\"?note=4c0998e9f7d64222\" title=\"89-df-godel-translation\">89-df-godel-translation</a> — Gödel--McKinsey--Tarski 翻译函数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Audit-Status\">Audit Status</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>2026-09-09：两轮语义修复已覆盖修复前的 201 个原子文件。</li>\n<li>当前目录含 206 个原子文件（不计本书籍元数据文件）；新增的 5 个原子\n用于补齐真实依赖，未以同名占位符绕过来源检查。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"The-Logic-of-Provability","text":"The Logic of Provability","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Author","text":"Author","level":2},{"id":"Description","text":"Description","level":2},{"id":"Core-Topics","text":"Core Topics","level":2},{"id":"Repair-Additions","text":"Repair Additions","level":2},{"id":"Audit-Status","text":"Audit Status","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"Repair Additions","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]] — 模态语言的命题重言式集合","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"Repair Additions","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]] — 模态子公式与出现变元集合","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-free-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"Repair Additions","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-free-fragment]] — 无盒命题片段","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic","status":"resolved","id":"f12af111ab11110d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headin